## 11. Success Metrics & KPIs

### 11.1. North Star Metric
**"Projects with a Compliance Health Score > 90."** This single metric encapsulates successful intake, complete permit identification, and active team coordination. It directly correlates to customer value and retention.

### 11.2. Key Performance Indicators (KPIs)

| Category | Metric | Target (MVP at 6 Months) | Business Rationale |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Revenue** | Net Revenue Retention (NRR) | >100% | Proves expansion covers churn. Core SaaS health metric. |
| **Revenue** | Monthly Recurring Revenue (MRR) | $30,000 | Measured growth from a base of $0. |
| **Retention** | Logo Churn Rate (Monthly) | <3% | Below 3% validates essential "system of record" status. |
| **Engagement** | Project Save Rate | >95% | Confirms users see lasting value in the digital locker. |
| **Engagement** | Sub Invite Rate | >1.5 invites per paying project | Measures the virality of the network effect. |
| **Product** | Time-to-Permit-List (P50) | <45 seconds | Core value proposition performance. |
| **Product** | AI Scope Tag Accuracy (Precision) | >90% (User-accepted vs. rejected) | Builds user trust and reduces correction overhead. |
| **Customer** | Customer Satisfaction (CSAT) | >85% "Satisfied" or "Very Satisfied" | Post-project-run survey. |

